title: Bee Stealer AI Profiling - ProfileEn.txt and ProfileRu.txt Artefacts
id: 608564a0-3bcf-40f3-b54f-d4767a91126f
status: experimental
description: Detects creation of the AI-generated victim profile files that Bee Stealer v2.1 writes after it submits stolen log content to a profiling model. The English and Russian profile artefacts (ProfileEn.txt, ProfileRu.txt) are what the November 2026 DarkForums marketplace turns into searchable victim profiles by role and access level.
references:
  - https://www.blackfog.com/bee-stealer-uses-ai-to-profile-victims/
  - https://bi.zone/eng/expertise/blog/stilery-vykhodyat-na-novyy-uroven-avtomaticheskoe-ii-profilirovanie/
  - https://www.infostealers.com/article/inside-the-ai-powered-marketplace-turning-infected-computers-into-searchable-profiles/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/11/17
tags:
  - attack.t1555
  - attack.t1539
  - attack.t1005
logsource:
  category: file_event
detection:
  selection_profile_names:
    TargetFilename|endswith:
      - '\ProfileEn.txt'
      - '\ProfileRu.txt'
      - '/ProfileEn.txt'
      - '/ProfileRu.txt'
  condition: selection_profile_names
falsepositives:
  - Any file pair deliberately named ProfileEn.txt/ProfileRu.txt will match; the paired naming is specific to Bee Stealer's profiling module, so validate the directory and the surrounding stealer artefacts before raising an incident
level: medium
